<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="WorkingwithClauses_unmarkClause" xml:lang="en">
   <title>To unmark a clause</title>
   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>You must have <xref href="../marking-clauses_45220111_45220111/45220111.dita" format="dita">marked static text in the agreement document as a clause</xref> in the same session using Playbook. Unmarking a clause removes Apttus clause properties and returns the text to a static state.</p>
      </context>
      <steps>
         <step>
            <cmd>Go to <menucascade>
                  <uicontrol>Document </uicontrol>
                  <uicontrol>Clauses</uicontrol>
               </menucascade>.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd> Click on the clause name in the list. </cmd>
            <stepresult>
               <p>The document scrolls to highlight the selected clause.</p>
               <fig id="fig_hmt_fw4_12c">
                  <image height="250" placement="break" width="773"
                     href="../attachments/45220112/49086821.png" id="image_imt_fw4_12c"/>
               </fig>
            </stepresult>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click the <image placement="inline" width="20"
                  href="../attachments/45220112/49086822.png" id="image_hkh_hw4_12c"/>
               <uicontrol>unMark </uicontrol>icon. </cmd>
            <stepresult>
               <p>The Panel refreshes and the clause no longer appears in the list. The clause
                  boundary is removed from the marked text and it returns to its previous state.</p>
            </stepresult>
         </step>
      </steps>
   </taskbody>
</task>